  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together fish sauce, rice vinegar, calamansi juice, grated ginger, garlic, sesame oil, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the pitted dates to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade.",
    "Thread 3-4 dates onto each skewer, leaving a small space between each date.",
    "Brush the grill with oil to prevent sticking.",
    "Grill the skewers for 2-3 minutes per side, or until slightly charred.",
    "Transfer the skewers to a serving plate and sprinkle with toasted sesame seeds.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
